  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2ea46d3882aef74590dff21d890a506, type: 3}
  m_Name: NodeLocalization
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _manager: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 324dd5f409d96054f9e148fc1779fab5, type: 2}
  wordList:
  - key: Demo Node Content
    englishText: 'This is a Demonstration Note!


      Notes support the Location
      system


      They can be used for:

      - Telling a Story

      - Presenting
      instructions in a Game

      - Hints to e.g. Safes, Codes

      - Many Others


      They
      support Rich Text:

      <color=red>- Colors</color>.

      <b>-Bold Text</b>.

      <u>-
      Underline</u>.

      <i>- Tilt</i>.

      <size=18>- Text size</size>.

      -
      And other features'
    stringList:
    - "To jest Demonstracyjna Notatka!\n\nNotatki obs\u0142uguj\u0105 system Lokalizacji\n\nMog\u0105
      one s\u0142u\u017Cy\u0107 do:\n- Opowiadania Historii\n- Przedstawienia Instrukcji
      w Grze\n- Podpowiedzi do np. Sejf\xF3w, Kod\xF3w\n- Wielu Innych\n\nObs\u0142uguj\u0105
      Rich Text:\n<color=red>- Kolory</color>\n<b>- Pogrubiony Text</b>\n<u>- Podkre\u015Blenie</u>\n<i>-
      Przechylenie</i>\n<size=18>- Wielko\u015B\u0107 Tekstu</size>\n- Oraz inne
      funkcje"
    - 
    - 
  - key: Demo Node Title
    englishText: Demo Note
    stringList:
    - Nota demonstracyjna
    - 
    - 
  - key: Keypad Code
    englishText: Keypad Codes
    stringList:
    - Kody klawiatury
    - 
    - 
  - key: Keypad Code Content
    englishText: 'Both Keypads have the code: 7412369'
    stringList:
    - "Oba Keypady maj\u0105 kod: 7412369"
    - 
    - 
  - key: Safe Codes Content
    englishText: "Here is the List of Codes for Safes:\n\n3 Slot | 0-9: \n<size=18><b>0
      | 1 | 2</b></size>.\n\n4 Slot | 0-9:\n<size=18><b>1 | 9 | 9 | 3</b></size>.\n\n3
      Slot | 0-99: \n<size=18><b>16 | 1 | 22</b></size>.\n\n4 Slot | 0-99: \n<size=18><b>22
      | 4 | 20 | 22</b></size>."
    stringList:
    - "Oto Lista Kod\xF3w do Sejf\xF3w:\n\n3 Slot | 0-9: \n<size=18><b>0 | 1 | 2</b></size>\n\n4
      Slot | 0-9:\n<size=18><b>1 | 9 | 9 | 3</b></size>\n\n3 Slot | 0-99: \n<size=18><b>16
      | 1 | 22</b></size>\n\n4 Slot | 0-99: \n<size=18><b>22 | 4 | 20 | 22</b></size>"
    - 
    - 
  - key: Safe Codes Title
    englishText: Safe Codes
    stringList:
    - Bezpieczne kody
    - 
    - 
